17:["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Vital signs are the most frequently performed clinical task in ambulatory care and among the most consequential, because providers make decisions from them without re-taking them. An inaccurate reading is not a neutral event; it produces a wrong clinical picture."}]
